+# Operationalization & Hardening Runbook (summary)
+
+Sections:
+- Install & label isolated runtimes (use ops/cluster/install_and_label_isolated_runtimes.sh; run runtime_validator_enhanced.py)
+- Deploy validator webhook with KMS-backed cosign key:
