+  - Replace CA bundle in deploy/webhook/validatingwebhook-config-validator.yaml and apply
+  - Run ops/cluster/runtime_acceptance_tests.sh to validate deny/allow flows
+- Create evidence WORM bucket:
+  - ./ops/evidence/create_s3_worm_bucket.sh <bucket> <region>
+- Wire CI signing:
+  - Add .github/workflows/cosign-sign.yml to your image build pipeline
+- Attestation:
+  - Run ops/attestation/attestation_pipeline.py nightly or via CI; store signed bundles in EVIDENCE_BUCKET
+- Watermark vendor & legal:
+  - Install vendor per services/serving/diffusers/watermark/vendor_provisioning.md
+  - Run ops/watermark/run_and_sign_forensics.py and send package to legal with ops/watermark/request_legal_signoff.sh
+- Moderation:
+  - Use services/serving/diffusers/moderation/dataset_tools.py to curate labeled data
+  - Run ops/moderation/run_calibrate_and_deploy.sh and ensure reviewer service is running
+- Multi-cloud:
+  - Use ops/cloud/setup_provider_secrets.sh to populate per-cloud secrets for KMS and evidence buckets
+- Billing:
+  - Deploy Postgres-backed quota service (services/quota/postgres_quota_service.py) and wire gateway with ops/gateway/enforce_quota.lua
+- Security:
+  - Apply ops/security/minimal_rbac.yaml, run ops/security/run_static_scans.sh regularly, rotate keys via ops/security/rotate_cosign_ref.sh
+- Audit:
+  - Periodically run ops/audit/collect_k8s_audit_and_upload.py and confirm evidence uploaded with SHA metadata
+
+Acceptance criteria (short)
+- Validator denies unsigned images in protected namespaces and allows cosign-signed images using KMS key.
+- Evidence stored in Object-Lock bucket and attestation bundles are cosign-signed and retrievable.
+- Watermark adv validation output meets policy thresholds and legal has signed off.
+- Moderation thresholds applied; reviewer backlog within SLA.
+- Quota service rejects over-quota requests; nightly reconciliation matches ledger.
+- Static scans run and are part of CI gating.
